Original version of irred from 2003:


irred version 3.15

https://maths-people.anu.edu.au/~brent/irred.html
updated URL:
https://maths-people.anu.edu.au/~brent/ftp/trinom/irred315.tar.gz


From the tarfile we really only need irred.c, which is reproduced in this directory as irred.orig.c,
which was modified by Claude AI into the current version of irred.c
for modern compilers and computer architectures.

However, the tarfile is included in this directory for completeness.
